/E (To achieve this, IKSHA is committed to building a robust ecosystem for knowledge creation and institutionalization through strategic academic collaborations. Our mission focuses on capacity building and nurturing future generations with the cultural cognition and scholarly rigor necessary to address modern challenges. By developing immersive training programs for the public and engaging stakeholders across business and government, we aim to mainstream IKS globally. Ultimately, IKSHA seeks to foster a culture of deliberation and intercultural exchange, creating an academic environment where Indian ways of being can contribute meaningfully to a more inclusive and pluralistic global discourse.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
